    "function": "A helicase/nuclease that prepares dsDNA breaks (DSB) for recombinational DNA repair. Binds to DSBs and unwinds DNA via a highly rapid and processive ATP-dependent bidirectional helicase activity. In the holoenzyme this subunit contributes ATPase, 3'-5' helicase, exonuclease activity and loads RecA onto ssDNA. Unlike the case in E.coli, suppresses RecA-dependent homologous recombination, is instead required for single-strand annealing pathway repair of DSB",
